    {
      "uid": "zhcn:567d241b8d3641cb9dfa1006",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的。它是菊科的草本植物——\n据说有放松身心、镇静和安神助眠的效果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5eb8ab0aae410d3a7a687a4b412cb1680993a3d5bce7d9c7b68548a800046b39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
