    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19d7d27cc7b311a8bd514356",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那能让人心情变得十分平静安宁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f249e144ac66a3ae4de9e32b55e77d3689043c821be1cb3566f11d2e8e4f30d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a780b3ba28b2f3d6be6bd2b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此，既然难得遇到，我们决定尝试一下这款特别内容饮品。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7c669193513a63cabbd38050bde35a839c855563d14d993c700f45f5a3d4c03",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        49,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/49/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e951109937800f514a1a357d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们时不时停下脚步，\n尽情欣赏完水仙花后，\n决定去咖啡厅休息一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "335b3b62268b83a66f229dfa293d8d2b37f4392ddc97219dc79da390f4262710",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a1ea6b9cc42c26faab21aa2",
      "kind": "story",
